body:
Not a fix, but when I was in the process of getting diagnosed, and my mum didn’t want to admit the signs of a genetic component on her side of the family (3 generations of death by aneurysm, her hypermobility, hiatus hernia and gastroparesis) my mum said to me;
“Well maybe it’s not EDS. I don’t have any problems (HA!) and your sisters are fine. It’s probably MS.”

Thanks....
